msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:30
msgid "The upgrade procedure, for example, is as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:39
msgid "Config/Constants.php"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:41
msgid ""
"The constants ``EVENT_PRIORITY_LOW``, ``EVENT_PRIORITY_NORMAL`` and "
"``EVENT_PRIORITY_HIGH`` are deprecated, and the definitions are moved to "
"``app/Config/Constants.php``. If you use these constants, define them in "
"``app/Config/Constants.php``. Or use new class constants "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_LOW``, "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_NORMAL`` and "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_HIGH``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:44
msgid "composer.json"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:46
msgid "This procedure is not required in v4.5.0 or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:48
msgid ""
"If you use Composer, when you installed CodeIgniter v4.1.9 or before, and"
" if there are ``App\\\\`` and ``Config\\\\`` namespaces in your "
"``/composer.json``'s ``autoload.psr-4`` like the following, you need to "
"remove these lines, and run ``composer dump-autoload``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:66
msgid "Breaking Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:68
msgid ""
"The ``system/bootstrap.php`` file no longer returns a ``CodeIgniter`` "
"instance, and does not load the ``.env`` file (now handled in "
"``index.php`` and ``spark``). If you have code that expects these "
"behaviors it will no longer work and must be modified. This has been "
"changed to make `Preloading "
"<https://www.php.net/manual/en/opcache.preloading.php>`_ easier to "
"implement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:71
msgid "Breaking Enhancements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:73
msgid ""
"The method signature of ``Validation::setRule()`` has been changed. The "
"``string`` typehint on the ``$rules`` parameter was removed. Extending "
"classes should likewise remove the parameter so as not to break LSP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:74
msgid ""
"The method signature of ``CodeIgniter\\Database\\BaseBuilder::join()`` "
"and ``CodeIgniter\\Database\\*\\Builder::join()`` have been changed. The "
"``string`` typehint on the ``$cond`` parameter was removed. Extending "
"classes should likewise remove the parameter so as not to break LSP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:77
msgid "Project Files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:79
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Numerous files in the **project space** (root, app, public, writable) "
"received updates. Due to these files being outside of the **system** "
"scope they will not be changed without your intervention. There are some "
"third-party CodeIgniter modules available to assist with merging changes "
"to the project space: `Explore on Packagist "
"<https://packagist.org/explore/?query=codeigniter4%20updates>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_420.rst:84
msgid ""
"Except in very rare cases for bug fixes, no changes made to files for the"
" project space will break your application. All changes noted here are "
"optional until the next major version, and any mandatory changes will be "
"covered in the sections above."
msgstr ""

